{"step_index":154,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:45:07Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T11:45:07+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T11:45:12+09:00\nThe search for \"\"글로픽스\" site:map.naver.com OR site:place.map.kakao.com\" returned the following summary:\n네이버 지도 및 카카오맵에서 **\"(주)글로픽스\"**를 검색하실 때 참고하실 수 있는 기업 정보 및 위치는 다음과 같습니다[1][2].\n\n* **회사명:** (주)글로픽스 (맞춤 스티커 제작 플랫폼 및 미디어·마케팅 관련 법인)[1][3]\n* **도로명 주소:** \n  * 부산광역시 해운대구 해운대해변로 203, 오션타워 1014호 (우동)[2][3]\n\n네이버 지도(naver.com/p/entry/place 등)나 카카오맵(map.kakao.com)에서 위 도로명 주소나 상호명인 **'글로픽스'** 또는 **'오션타워'**를 검색하시면 상세한 위치, 지도 서비스별 길찾기 및 주변 대중교통 정보를 확인하실 수 있습니다[1][4][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [thinkzon.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEud8khcxQ7iIvjrU7hcgJwqzwdccLV-0ueUF1UBUIEs7xlHcLgf3nYyR5c1LXMId1UnDbY3eHDam8Ar1CQuhibBEkyTl-7P4_pTCQIazFybRfofm8D9hGla8bns01gZoF4uZcz1g==)\n[2] [saramin.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGAaoY_fTdlmv80Y0rQetobpFwxBW2zPYqNztfTBLPryc-MR2spFDgb7q3HTVKg1cQN9GHvFzUWO68wmKLHQ-Acmd-4kFkmrBW1k1uyzx3JnHRHST9c4MJVHxb8TocH-pKO5GcscLv4yGuWGlOrPdYLn0QhoFM2IQCDNH3pt-unA1u_-Xz5gYeIhG33lXPYY_N1ywJHqpiyOzBEsRiKmMTD-9eyuw2jtQqwUQKuuvLzPGZtcIOsJya0EIHvL5un8Ao7HGW93lIts9nGXNTcdw==)\n[3] [musticker.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFu4vWa5-4vW2MurOItxwA7VEnCzsP3nJ1UEma7sDYhg225DOzr82Um4CpqEv5vGIsEL1tAcMY2wPqlgzFJ4BRyTR5rN-DXLFUwUTCa6XWM1hy_Xpd5XR1sQULX3ZWZI7uaRhYCLlllKU0NFg==)\n[4] [zendesk.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHTufiaO-Ns_bGaoxHGpBUWxF5VWiT433gX8wj8ocPjMolPItfucEY2G14aEEDYw015Ka9EpswDGNFLBPIasfo_aHzu2A1m4rWS4-uxySBWwGE76G4Pf41SW3xt7p6kUv13QCoTAnGlqR335owkUGAkE4-aq48Vgq6YmM-sbWWkjlanPtq87UziV_7SYKW7L1PoPF9VYRByvfViBarhs_zU17FdVbsQR0PzeWsjA2VBc2CS4QA3rVFnWwQ31Tml4geZi4UnZ_U_UIs4hFHizUmem4_AhqPA5f3iLIdopkMEciLL-gPL6DMIq6UDJk4K3OayvHCXLiKODTtqlR0mQd8er0R0wnxMunq9Zthsoh5hLeJooZYKoz__4EjjKIzMQS5RDz22gi8